{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/samSelectDetailRegion"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"DotFaceCore"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"samSelectDetailRegion"}],"externalID":"c:@F@samSelectDetailRegion","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"samSelectDetailRegion"}],"symbolKind":"func","roleHeading":"Function","title":"samSelectDetailRegion"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/dotfacecore\/samselectdetailregion"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:I"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samSelectDetailRegion","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/sam_color_image","text":"SamColorImage","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@sam_color_image"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"image","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:I"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"detectedObjectBoundingBox","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:I"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"selectedBoundingBox","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":");","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0 on success, or a non-zero error code on failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analyzes the input image and identifies the most suitable 200x200 pixel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"region (bounding box) with high level of details that intersects a given bounding box."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox"},{"type":"text","text":" is empty (width or height is 0), any region can be selected. Otherwise,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the selected region should have non-empty intersection with this bounding box. The selected region"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should lie fully inside the input image."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is no region satisfying these conditions - if image width or height is smaller than 200"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox"},{"type":"text","text":" lies outside the image, the selected bounding box will be (0, 0, 200, 200)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["                                  a bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height)."],"type":"codeListing"},{"syntax":null,"code":["                                  return, contains the bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height),","                                  where width and height are always set to 200."],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"references":{"doc://DotFaceCore/documentation/DotFaceCore":{"title":"DotFaceCore","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"version: 9.8.0","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/dotfacecore"},"doc://DotFaceCore/documentation/DotFaceCore/samSelectDetailRegion":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentati